BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Mr. Chairman, Your Honor, I think the best way first to do is one step at a time.

3502
02:00:20,880 --> 02:00:27,340
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Detach BJMP from the ILG and make BJMP as a bureau.

3503
02:00:27,340 --> 02:00:34,060
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Initially as a bureau, and then when the time comes that really we can merge these two.

3504
02:00:34,080 --> 02:00:39,940
Senator Panfilo Lacson: BJMP is effectively a bureau under the DILG, just like the PNP and the BFP, di ba?

3505
