3506
02:00:41,900 --> 02:00:43,620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, ano, separate bureau?

3507
02:00:43,880 --> 02:00:54,200
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Initially po, para because we have internal problems in Bucor, I want to solve them maybe before 2028.

3508
02:00:54,200 --> 02:00:56,660
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And also BJMP.

3509
02:00:57,340 --> 02:01:04,400
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Can have a sunset review by our good secretary to really how to merge this.

3510
02:01:05,560 --> 02:01:13,560
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Because in other countries, it's a unified penology and correctional system.

3511
02:01:13,940 --> 02:01:16,900
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And they call it the Bureau of Correctional Services.

3512
02:01:18,180 --> 02:01:20,020
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, in the future, it will be merged.

3513
02:01:21,280 --> 02:01:26,820
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Senator, if I may, the first step would be transferring the BJMP.

3514
02:01:27,340 --> 02:01:29,520
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: From the DILG to the DOJ.

3515
02:01:29,880 --> 02:01:31,540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Then that will pave the way for that.

3516
02:01:31,680 --> 02:01:37,480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Especially with the residual powers of the President.

3517
02:01:38,740 --> 02:01:42,620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: I think legally, no need for a new law for that.

3518
02:01:45,240 --> 02:01:47,520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Senator Ping and Secretary Vida.

3519
02:01:48,620 --> 02:01:50,220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: An executive order will do.

3520
02:01:51,000 --> 02:01:52,420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Under the administrative code.

3521
02:01:52,420 --> 02:01:55,180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Actually, we did that under President Aquino's time.

3522
02:01:55,560 --> 02:01:57,320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We took away the NFA.

3523
02:01:57,340 --> 02:01:59,340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The NIA.

3524
02:01:59,980 --> 02:02:05,200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The Pesticide and Fertilizer Authority.

3525
02:02:05,760 --> 02:02:07,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the Philippine Coconut Authority.

3526
02:02:07,700 --> 02:02:10,660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We took it all away from the Department of Agriculture.

3527
02:02:11,120 --> 02:02:12,980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And put it under the office of the President.

3528
02:02:13,800 --> 02:02:15,540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: By way of executive order.

3529
02:02:16,120 --> 02:02:22,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, an executive order can now transfer the BJMP from the DILG.

3530
02:02:23,400 --> 02:02:25,440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Unless there is a law.

3531
02:02:25,520 --> 02:02:26,320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But I don't think so.

3532
02:02:26,320 --> 02:02:27,320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The law is.

3533
02:02:27,360 --> 02:02:28,380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The administrative code.

3534
02:02:29,420 --> 02:02:29,820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Correct?

3535
