DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Good morning, Your Honors.

3544
02:02:53,160 --> 02:02:55,440
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: At first, we were looking at two ways to do it.

3545
02:02:55,600 --> 02:02:57,100
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: First one would be through legislation.

3546
