DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: But during the study, we figured out that this was done before through an executive order.

3547
02:03:02,960 --> 02:03:09,700
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: The only law that could probably be maybe a problem for this would be the local government code.

3548
02:03:10,420 --> 02:03:16,600
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Because the provincial jails, according to the local government code, belongs to the provincial.

3549
02:03:17,080 --> 02:03:19,360
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: That's the only problem, Your Honors.

3550
02:03:21,160 --> 02:03:21,500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah.

3551
