3596
02:05:26,640 --> 02:05:27,180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Actually, nakalagay po.

3597
02:05:27,180 --> 02:05:31,340
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Nakalagay po na wala pong nakalagay na provisions na gano'n.

3598
02:05:31,440 --> 02:05:37,320
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Pero we are actually requesting for that para lang po sana yung ikot po ng tao.

3599
02:05:37,320 --> 02:05:41,220
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: We only have about 370 agents po sa buong Pilipinas po.

3600
02:05:41,880 --> 02:05:42,680
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ganun lang po karami.

3601
02:05:42,780 --> 02:05:47,180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Pero nagsulat na po kami sa DBM to increase the number of our agents.

3602
02:05:47,920 --> 02:05:50,040
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Kasi under the modernization,

3603
02:05:50,760 --> 02:05:54,740
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: ang minimum po na requirement na agents namin per region at per district.

3604
02:05:54,740 --> 02:05:57,140
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: When you say district, yung province po, the 82 provinces.

3605
02:05:57,180 --> 02:06:01,180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Now, 6 dapat per region at per district.

3606
02:06:02,040 --> 02:06:04,140
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ganyan po, we only have 370 po.

3607
02:06:04,140 --> 02:06:06,300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Director Melvin, kindly check again.

3608
02:06:06,560 --> 02:06:10,600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi baka may naliligaw na provision para budget na lang yung problema.

3609
02:06:11,880 --> 02:06:16,000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Baka mayroong provision doon na related na pwedeng lagyan ng budget.

3610
02:06:16,960 --> 02:06:19,560
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pakireview na lang ulit yung NBI modernization.

3611
02:06:20,400 --> 02:06:21,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi kapapasa lang yan.

3612
02:06:22,720 --> 02:06:25,400
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Baka naman mayroong naliligaw doon na nabanggit yung hazard.

3613
02:06:25,840 --> 02:06:26,520
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sige po.

3614
02:06:27,180 --> 02:06:28,320
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Nagsulat na lang po namin sa inyo po.

3615
02:06:28,460 --> 02:06:29,460
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Maraming salamat po.

3616
02:06:29,960 --> 02:06:31,620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Address it to the chairman of the committee.

3617
02:06:31,900 --> 02:06:32,860
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ito pala meron oh.

3618
02:06:32,920 --> 02:06:33,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: There you go.

3619
02:06:34,340 --> 02:06:34,900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead sir.

