3627
02:06:51,420 --> 02:06:52,640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So hindi na kailangan ng legislation.

3628
02:06:53,300 --> 02:06:54,260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: It's already there.

3629
02:06:56,240 --> 02:06:57,040
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Yes sir.

3630
02:06:57,180 --> 02:06:58,980
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: That's why we're requesting po for the...

3631
02:06:58,980 --> 02:07:00,980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kaya, mag-usap pala kayo ng chairman.

3632
02:07:01,100 --> 02:07:01,280
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Opo.

3633
02:07:01,900 --> 02:07:05,200
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: 97 million po yung computation namin for everyone po.

3634
02:07:05,480 --> 02:07:08,680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Please address it to the chairman of the committee just through me.

3635
02:07:09,060 --> 02:07:11,300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Chairman through the vice chairman.

3636
02:07:11,680 --> 02:07:12,040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you.

3637
02:07:12,500 --> 02:07:13,080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead sir.

3638
02:07:14,420 --> 02:07:17,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, just a few more points sa Mr. Chair.

3639
02:07:18,620 --> 02:07:21,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, dahil ka-ask to us, Commissioner Joel.

3640
02:07:23,380 --> 02:07:24,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Viado sa BI.

3641
02:07:24,840 --> 02:07:24,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

3642
02:07:25,020 --> 02:07:25,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung pong...

3643
02:07:27,180 --> 02:07:29,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: e-gates and Border Management System.

3644
02:07:29,420 --> 02:07:30,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi budget eh.

3645
02:07:30,500 --> 02:07:31,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya I have to ask.

3646
02:07:32,100 --> 02:07:32,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As early as

3647
02:07:32,720 --> 02:07:38,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2017, Bureau of Immigration has been receiving allocation for its Border Management Information System.

3648
02:07:39,140 --> 02:07:45,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: From 2017 to 2026, the project has received a total allocation of almost 10 billion. For 2027,

3649
02:07:46,600 --> 02:07:51,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Allocation of BMIS is just 524 million.

3650
02:07:51,820 --> 02:07:54,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero through the years, malaki na rin ito.

3651
02:07:54,740 --> 02:07:58,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2024, 2.6 billion.

3652
02:07:58,320 --> 02:08:00,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2025, 3.8 billion.

3653
02:08:01,400 --> 02:08:03,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026, 1.8 billion.

3654
02:08:04,460 --> 02:08:08,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just like to ask, medyo malaki kasi ito.

3655
02:08:08,060 --> 02:08:16,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But what are the components so that everybody will understand of this project aside from the expansion of the e-gates in our international ports?

3656
02:08:16,460 --> 02:08:16,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano po ito?

3657
02:08:16,940 --> 02:08:17,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For convenience lang?

3658
02:08:17,980 --> 02:08:23,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Or does it include the software, lahat po ng information system?

3659
02:08:23,080 --> 02:08:24,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably can...

3660
02:08:24,740 --> 02:08:27,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You can expound, Commissioner Joel.

3661
02:08:27,940 --> 02:08:28,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes.

3662
02:08:28,320 --> 02:08:31,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Thank you very much po, Senator Ejercito.

3663
02:08:31,480 --> 02:08:33,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: With the permission of our Honorable Secretary.

3664
02:08:33,580 --> 02:08:44,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang components po ng e-gates project po namin, which aims to not only strengthen border control but also modernize the primary immigration processing,

3665
02:08:46,000 --> 02:08:52,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: accelerate clearances, prevent fraud, and streamline the immigration processing through biometric verification.

3666
02:08:53,520 --> 02:08:54,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang components po niyan are the following.

3667
02:08:54,740 --> 02:08:59,540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: First, biometrics capture device in manned inspection counters.

3668
02:09:00,280 --> 02:09:16,040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang description po nito, it is a self-contained device at manned counters, which will capture the traveler's biometric data, such as fingerprints and facial images, with seamless software integration for operation.

3669
02:09:17,040 --> 02:09:19,980
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Number two po, yung hardware po ng e-gates.

3670
02:09:20,080 --> 02:09:21,500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung nakikita po natin.

3671
02:09:21,500 --> 02:09:24,500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: These are automated self-service gates.

3672
02:09:24,740 --> 02:09:31,080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: These are the gates that allow eligible travelers to clear immigration without going through a manned counter.

3673
02:09:31,800 --> 02:09:45,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito pong e-gates, they read the traveler's passport, they capture live biometrics, they verify the person's identity against the passport, they check the regulatory records, and open the gates if all checks are passed.

3674
02:09:46,360 --> 02:09:52,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasama rin po dito ang automated biometric identification system, o yung tinatawag po nating ABIS.

3675
02:09:52,000 --> 02:09:54,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's the central system that stores...

3676
02:09:54,740 --> 02:10:01,060
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's the central system that stores and matches face and fingerprint data for real-time identity verification and fraud detection.

3677
02:10:02,200 --> 02:10:04,620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong e-gates monitoring station.

3678
02:10:05,220 --> 02:10:13,020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po ang workstations used by immigration officers to monitor the status and performance of all e-gates in real-time.

3679
02:10:13,800 --> 02:10:22,040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The system shows whether each gate is operational, in use, or requires assistance, allowing officers to respond quickly to any issues.

3680
02:10:22,300 --> 02:10:24,620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andyan din po ang border control data.

3681
02:10:24,720 --> 02:10:27,620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: exchange platform, or BCDEP.

3682
02:10:28,480 --> 02:10:35,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The secure platform that enables safe, real-time data sharing among border control systems and agencies.

3683
02:10:36,480 --> 02:10:38,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andyan din po ang administrative back-end system.

3684
02:10:39,420 --> 02:10:45,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The management system for monitoring usage, performance, and configuration of e-gates and related components.

3685
02:10:46,180 --> 02:10:48,760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong document verification software.

3686
02:10:48,760 --> 02:10:53,760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It displays all verification results performed on the passport within the immigration...

3687
02:10:54,720 --> 02:10:56,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...officer's interface.

3688
02:10:57,440 --> 02:11:00,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nakaka-indicate po siya ng any detected anomalies or inconsistencies.

3689
02:11:01,200 --> 02:11:03,100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong network requirements.

3690
02:11:03,920 --> 02:11:07,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kailangan po kasi yung communications infrastructure maigi.

3691
02:11:07,880 --> 02:11:14,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nandun po yung switchers, routers, cabling, tsaka yung Wi-Fi that can securely connect all e-gate components.

3692
02:11:14,840 --> 02:11:17,940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong server requirements na kailangan pong kasusan.

3693
02:11:18,480 --> 02:11:23,940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The servers host and run core e-gate systems to handle transactions reliably...

3694
02:11:24,720 --> 02:11:26,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...and support future growth.

3695
02:11:27,140 --> 02:11:28,840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Bangsan po po ang system integration.

3696
02:11:29,180 --> 02:11:35,300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It will connect all e-gates and biometric systems with the border control information system...

3697
02:11:35,300 --> 02:11:39,500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...and other databases for real-time checks and smooth passenger flow.

3698
02:11:40,180 --> 02:11:43,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong backup and disaster recovery.

3699
02:11:43,320 --> 02:11:46,020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung kung mag-down yung system, dapat po may backup.

3700
02:11:46,760 --> 02:11:54,480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The data backups and redundant systems aim to protect information and restore operations quickly.

3701
02:11:54,720 --> 02:11:56,760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: After failures or disruptions.

3702
02:11:57,520 --> 02:12:02,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong kailangan kasusan na support, maintenance, and warranty.

3703
02:12:02,900 --> 02:12:11,280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: For ongoing technical support, preventive maintenance, and repairs to keep all e-gates components running reliably.

3704
02:12:11,940 --> 02:12:18,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And last but not the least, anyan po yung training or structured training for the officers and staff...

3705
02:12:18,140 --> 02:12:22,820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...on operating, monitoring, and maintaining the e-gates and associated systems.

3706
02:12:23,220 --> 02:12:24,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So we have to consider...

3707
02:12:24,720 --> 02:12:31,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...your honors, na hindi lang po yung hardware ang kailangan pong paglaanan ng budget.

3708
02:12:31,180 --> 02:12:37,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andiyan po ang isang system na kailangan tumakbo not only in the airports in Metro Manila...

3709
02:12:37,740 --> 02:12:41,080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...but interconnected with all the other airports in the whole Philippines.

3710
02:12:41,640 --> 02:12:41,900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

3711
02:12:42,400 --> 02:12:48,640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Chair Chairman, ang facial identification or facial recognition, yung requirement ninyo?

3712
02:12:48,860 --> 02:12:50,080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Facial recognition, yung requirement.

3713
02:12:50,080 --> 02:12:51,040
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Recognition, mahal yan.

3714
02:12:52,280 --> 02:12:54,560
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We have been working, your honor...

3715
02:12:54,560 --> 02:12:54,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...with the...

3716
02:12:54,720 --> 02:12:59,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...within the budget, kung ano po ang naibigay sa amin pong budget po ng ating pong kapulungan.

3717
02:13:00,320 --> 02:13:02,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yun po, we're working within that po.

3718
02:13:02,600 --> 02:13:12,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So ang stages po niyan, ang first phase po, 1.9 billion, but we were able to lower that to 1.5 billion po.

3719
02:13:12,700 --> 02:13:23,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And secondly po, Your Honor, yung phase 2 po ng proyekto namin is around [unclear].

3720
02:13:23,740 --> 02:13:29,340
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 1 billion 347 million 57 thousand.

3721
02:13:29,340 --> 02:13:32,120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi ko kasanayin na magbasa ng napakaraming...

3722
02:13:32,120 --> 02:13:33,800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Lagi mo inisip yung milyon.

3723
02:13:33,820 --> 02:13:35,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Lagi, laging, laging, ano po.

3724
02:13:36,060 --> 02:13:45,040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And phase 3 po ng proyekto is for 2026, 536,072,000, your honors.

3725
02:13:45,420 --> 02:13:45,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

3726
02:13:46,140 --> 02:13:50,220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi basically, di ba, pagka facial identification, ang tanong lang, sino to?

3727
02:13:51,300 --> 02:13:53,700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero pagka facial recognition, may matching.

3728
02:13:53,700 --> 02:13:54,360
Senator Panfilo Lacson: May matching pa ito, di ba?

3729
02:13:54,520 --> 02:13:55,400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, po, your honor.

3730
02:13:55,680 --> 02:13:59,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kaya po, meron po kaming biometric capturing systems po na binili.

3731
02:13:59,300 --> 02:14:04,960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Not only the hardware, but meron pong biometric capturing devices po na binili, your honor.

3732
02:14:05,080 --> 02:14:05,960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasi yan po ang crucial.

3733
02:14:07,000 --> 02:14:14,600
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron pa nga pong instances, your honor, na meron pong airports na maaring hindi kailangan ng e-gates because of the passenger traffic,

3734
02:14:15,120 --> 02:14:17,680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pero kailangan ng biometric identification system.

3735
02:14:18,040 --> 02:14:18,460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

3736
02:14:19,180 --> 02:14:23,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sa Southeast Asia, tayo na lang ba yung walang facial recognition?

3737
02:14:24,520 --> 02:14:31,660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi ko po masabi sa buong Southeast Asia, your honor, but I've been to different airports all over Southeast Asia and Asia.

3738
02:14:32,440 --> 02:14:42,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nakita ko na po yan sa, of course, Singapore, ang Indonesia, sa Bali, ang dami po nilang mga e-gates, ang Japan, of course, and Korea.

3739
02:14:42,420 --> 02:14:45,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po. Marami po talagang mga bansa, your honors, na gumagamit.

3740
02:14:45,260 --> 02:14:49,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kindly walk us through, no? Pagka meron na tayong facial recognition technology.

3741
02:14:50,220 --> 02:14:50,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

3742
02:14:52,780 --> 02:14:53,260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anong...

3743
02:14:53,260 --> 02:14:54,420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anong mako-cover nito?

3744
02:14:54,780 --> 02:14:58,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pagdating ng pasahero, wala na tayo yung mga boots.

3745
02:14:58,880 --> 02:14:59,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

3746
02:14:59,580 --> 02:15:00,000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

3747
02:15:00,000 --> 02:15:00,880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

3748
02:15:00,880 --> 02:15:01,260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hanggang Pochina.

3749
02:15:01,900 --> 02:15:02,420
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

3750
02:15:02,500 --> 02:15:04,500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: That is the ultimate objective, Your Honor.

3751
02:15:04,660 --> 02:15:06,400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Gaya po ng sa ibang bansa, Your Honor.

3752
02:15:06,520 --> 02:15:08,080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nadadaan na lang po kayo sa Amerika po.

3753
02:15:08,180 --> 02:15:08,360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganun.

3754
02:15:08,640 --> 02:15:10,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdaan, nakaka-capture na po lahat.

3755
02:15:10,340 --> 02:15:11,200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Lahat captured na.

3756
02:15:11,340 --> 02:15:14,560
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, you don't need to queue.

3757
02:15:14,720 --> 02:15:14,800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Di ba?

3758
02:15:14,880 --> 02:15:15,900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi ka na magka-queue.

3759
02:15:15,980 --> 02:15:16,900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

3760
02:15:17,080 --> 02:15:17,540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganun po.

3761
02:15:17,700 --> 02:15:20,820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because to which is own, you just go through.

3762
02:15:21,560 --> 02:15:22,520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

3763
02:15:22,920 --> 02:15:25,460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang maganda po kasi sa ganitong approach, Your Honor,

3764
02:15:26,140 --> 02:15:27,760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yung manual counters po,

3765
02:15:27,760 --> 02:15:30,940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kung hindi mababawasan, matatanggal totally.

3766
02:15:31,300 --> 02:15:34,020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But we are adopting a step-ladder approach.

3767
02:15:34,360 --> 02:15:35,760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasi po, we have to admit,

3768
02:15:36,220 --> 02:15:37,960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kumbaga ho sa levels,

3769
02:15:38,440 --> 02:15:40,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kumbaga ho nandito pa ho tayo sa level 1.

3770
02:15:40,300 --> 02:15:43,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi naman ho pwedeng agad-agad na sa level number 10 po tayo.

3771
02:15:44,060 --> 02:15:46,840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we have to go through the different processes and phases.

3772
02:15:47,400 --> 02:15:51,200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: At ito po ang naisip namin na unang hakbang po,

3773
02:15:51,460 --> 02:15:53,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: patungo po doon sa ating adhikain,

3774
02:15:53,740 --> 02:15:57,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na lahat e dumaan doon sa tinatawag po nating artificial intelligence.

3775
02:15:57,820 --> 02:15:58,160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

3776
02:15:58,360 --> 02:15:59,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po ang...

3777
02:15:59,140 --> 02:16:00,620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala nang human intervention.

3778
02:16:00,840 --> 02:16:01,460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

3779
02:16:01,580 --> 02:16:02,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: That would...

3780
02:16:02,380 --> 02:16:04,800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang problema nyo, saan nyo itatapon yung mga employees ninyo?

3781
02:16:05,040 --> 02:16:07,860
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor, we have to consider yun po,

3782
02:16:08,020 --> 02:16:12,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na we are expecting passenger traffic to really increase exponentially.

3783
02:16:13,200 --> 02:16:15,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we still need the immigration personnel.

3784
02:16:16,140 --> 02:16:19,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We also need people to man the different e-gates

3785
02:16:19,700 --> 02:16:21,100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and the different systems.

3786
02:16:21,460 --> 02:16:25,840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ultimately po, maari pong ma-prevent siya from entering,

3787
02:16:26,340 --> 02:16:27,100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but...

3788
02:16:27,760 --> 02:16:30,020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The discretion of the immigration officers still remains.

3789
02:16:30,120 --> 02:16:30,880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, kailangan pa rin po namin.

3790
02:16:30,880 --> 02:16:32,820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, how much do we need for the first phase?

3791
02:16:33,520 --> 02:16:35,820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 1.3 billion.

3792
02:16:36,160 --> 02:16:37,820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Na ibigay na po sa amin, Your Honor.

3793
02:16:37,860 --> 02:16:38,480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ah, nandiyan na.

3794
02:16:38,640 --> 02:16:40,400
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, in the works na ito?

3795
02:16:40,600 --> 02:16:41,540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

3796
02:16:42,280 --> 02:16:43,600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, where are we now?

3797
02:16:44,820 --> 02:16:45,600
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa ano po?

3798
02:16:46,380 --> 02:16:49,040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa phase 2 na po tayo, Your Honor.

3799
02:16:49,660 --> 02:16:50,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nasa phase 2 na po.

3800
02:16:50,220 --> 02:16:50,840
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nasa NEP yan?

3801
02:16:51,820 --> 02:16:52,800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

3802
02:16:54,280 --> 02:16:56,620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sufficient or not enough?

3803
02:16:56,620 --> 02:16:58,220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung nasa NEP?

3804
02:17:01,500 --> 02:17:02,160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sapat na ba?

3805
02:17:02,260 --> 02:17:04,120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Enough na po, Your Honor.

3806
02:17:04,480 --> 02:17:05,800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: If I may, Your Honor.

3807
02:17:05,800 --> 02:17:06,880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala na po nga, pigi-usapang budget.

3808
02:17:08,560 --> 02:17:09,160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay na po.

3809
02:17:09,720 --> 02:17:10,360
