3938
02:21:49,520 --> 02:21:52,280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ah, hindi makakatuloy, Your Honor.

3939
02:21:52,540 --> 02:21:55,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, sige, marami kasi may HDO ngayon, eh.

3940
02:21:55,080 --> 02:21:57,600
