3943
02:22:00,900 --> 02:22:01,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pupula.

3944
02:22:01,340 --> 02:22:03,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nakita ko doon, ano, Mr. Chair,

3945
02:22:03,300 --> 02:22:04,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nandaming e-gates green, eh.

3946
02:22:04,920 --> 02:22:05,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ibig sabihin...

3947
02:22:05,840 --> 02:22:06,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Tuloy lang po.

3948
02:22:06,500 --> 02:22:07,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Go yun, tuloy-tuloy lang.

3949
02:22:07,900 --> 02:22:09,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, pag pumula, may problema.

3950
02:22:09,460 --> 02:22:10,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

3951
02:22:11,300 --> 02:22:13,580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Doon makakailanganin yung human intervention.

3952
02:22:13,880 --> 02:22:14,520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

3953
02:22:14,600 --> 02:22:15,620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Taba po kayo ito, Your Honor.

3954
02:22:16,760 --> 02:22:18,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, hindi naman babawasan, no,

3955
02:22:18,320 --> 02:22:19,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung mga immigration officers natin?

3956
02:22:19,980 --> 02:22:20,640
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi po, Your Honor.

3957
02:22:20,640 --> 02:22:21,660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: As a matter of fact,

3958
02:22:21,660 --> 02:22:22,460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ngayon po,

3959
02:22:22,540 --> 02:22:24,320
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kulang pa nga po tayo, Your Honor, eh.

3960
02:22:24,440 --> 02:22:26,700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But we make do with whatever is given to us.

3961
02:22:27,300 --> 02:22:29,480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Initially, I've been reiterating po,

3962
02:22:30,060 --> 02:22:31,740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang immigration officers po natin

3963
02:22:31,740 --> 02:22:33,200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa buong Pilipinas,

3964
02:22:33,480 --> 02:22:36,340
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: around 1,800, 1,900.

3965
02:22:37,300 --> 02:22:37,800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

3966
02:22:37,880 --> 02:22:39,880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ikukumpira po natin yan sa ibang bansa

3967
02:22:39,880 --> 02:22:41,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na hindi naman po kasi laki

3968
02:22:41,220 --> 02:22:44,300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ng ating borders o teritoryo.

3969
02:22:45,020 --> 02:22:48,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Japan, I think, has about 5,000, 6,000, 7,000.

3970
02:22:48,520 --> 02:22:49,300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Japan po yan.

3971
02:22:49,920 --> 02:22:52,080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Dati po, may nakausap po ko galing Singapore.

3972
02:22:52,540 --> 02:22:54,540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nagtatakaw po siya, nung tinanong po niya,

3973
02:22:54,540 --> 02:22:56,200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ilan ang immigration officers niyon?

3974
02:22:56,200 --> 02:22:58,200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sabi ko, less than 2,000 what?

3975
02:22:58,200 --> 02:23:01,940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And considering na pagdating po sa land area,

3976
02:23:01,940 --> 02:23:04,800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: napakaliit po ng kanilang area,

3977
02:23:04,800 --> 02:23:06,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kukupira po sa atin.

3978
02:23:06,140 --> 02:23:09,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And we don't only have to contend with the land area,

3979
02:23:09,140 --> 02:23:11,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we have to contend with the coastal areas.

3980
02:23:11,140 --> 02:23:17,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Milyon-milyon po ng metro kwadrado ang ating economic zone,

3981
02:23:17,140 --> 02:23:19,140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: exclusive economic zone po natin.

3982
02:23:19,140 --> 02:23:20,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang coastal areas po natin,

3983
02:23:20,240 --> 02:23:21,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: daan-libu po yan

3984
02:23:21,240 --> 02:23:22,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ng

3985
02:23:22,380 --> 02:23:24,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kilometro kwadrado.

3986
02:23:24,380 --> 02:23:26,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we have to contend with that.

3987
02:23:26,380 --> 02:23:32,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And I've been telling those who have been asking

3988
02:23:32,380 --> 02:23:35,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang kinalakihan po natin nun,

3989
02:23:35,380 --> 02:23:37,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 7,100 islands ang Pilipinas.

3990
02:23:37,380 --> 02:23:39,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po, 7,600 na.

3991
02:23:39,380 --> 02:23:44,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And divide that with the number of officers that we have,

3992
02:23:44,380 --> 02:23:49,380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on the average, one officer has to take care of four islands.

3993
02:23:49,380 --> 02:23:52,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron ho mga instances kung naano eh,

3994
02:23:52,220 --> 02:23:56,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kala po namin nung una eh, parang, ano lang ho, hindi nangyayari.

3995
02:23:56,220 --> 02:24:00,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But I was able to talk to one officer in a single day.

3996
02:24:00,220 --> 02:24:06,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: She went to four islands in one day just to check on the situation.

3997
02:24:06,220 --> 02:24:08,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganyan po ang ano.

3998
02:24:08,220 --> 02:24:10,220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, kailangan po natin na mas marami ring officers yan.

3999
02:24:10,220 --> 02:24:12,220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Masama dun sa four islands ang island of Luzon.

4000
02:24:14,220 --> 02:24:15,220
