02:33:36,720 --> 02:33:40,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: they operate the system with other partners

4186
02:33:40,720 --> 02:33:43,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: within four major cities po.

4187
02:33:43,720 --> 02:33:47,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Four major airports in four major cities in the United States.

4188
02:33:47,720 --> 02:33:49,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din po sila sa Asia,

4189
02:33:49,720 --> 02:33:52,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: meron po sa Africa and Europe.

4190
02:33:52,720 --> 02:33:54,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po, all over the world po.

4191
02:33:54,720 --> 02:33:56,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Merong ano, diba?

4192
02:33:56,720 --> 02:33:58,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May information na,

4193
02:33:58,720 --> 02:34:02,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yun sa manifesto pa lang ng mga incoming passengers,

4194
02:34:02,720 --> 02:34:05,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: possible ba na malalaman nyo na

4195
02:34:05,720 --> 02:34:07,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na meron itong mga ito,

4196
02:34:07,720 --> 02:34:09,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or these people are,

4197
02:34:09,720 --> 02:34:11,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: halimbawa, international terrorist,

4198
02:34:11,720 --> 02:34:13,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or fugitive,

4199
02:34:13,720 --> 02:34:15,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: o meron yung records sa iba?

4200
02:34:15,720 --> 02:34:17,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasama rin ba ito sa ano?

4201
02:34:17,720 --> 02:34:18,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasama na rin dito?

4202
02:34:18,720 --> 02:34:19,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

4203
02:34:19,720 --> 02:34:20,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po ang tinatawag na

4204
02:34:20,720 --> 02:34:22,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Advanced Passenger Information System.

4205
02:34:22,720 --> 02:34:23,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

4206
02:34:23,720 --> 02:34:25,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: bago pa po mag-board,

4207
02:34:25,720 --> 02:34:29,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pagka nagbigay na po ng manifesto ang isang aeroplano,

4208
02:34:29,720 --> 02:34:32,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pag sakay po ng isang tao sa airport,

4209
02:34:32,720 --> 02:34:35,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: doon sa aeroplano po sa airport,

4210
02:34:35,720 --> 02:34:37,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on the way or in transit,

4211
02:34:37,720 --> 02:34:39,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ibabato na po sa amin yung information.

4212
02:34:39,720 --> 02:34:43,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So malalaman po namin kung isa pong tao ay dapat papasukin sa atin.

4213
02:34:43,720 --> 02:34:45,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So we have been using this system

4214
02:34:45,720 --> 02:34:47,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na-exclude po ang ibang,

4215
02:34:47,720 --> 02:34:50,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: marami na pong mga nagtatangka rito magtago,

4216
02:34:50,720 --> 02:34:52,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: o mga pugante po,

4217
02:34:52,720 --> 02:34:55,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: o fugitives from other countries.

4218
02:34:55,720 --> 02:34:57,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito pong system ng CAIS

4219
02:34:57,720 --> 02:34:59,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: will integrate and

4220
02:34:59,720 --> 02:35:02,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: also improve upon that system.

4221
02:35:02,720 --> 02:35:05,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So pagka dito sa CAIS project po,

4222
02:35:05,720 --> 02:35:07,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: let's say meron ho 20 years ago,

4223
02:35:07,720 --> 02:35:10,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: a certain person made a pronouncement,

4224
02:35:10,720 --> 02:35:13,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: posted it on the web,

4225
02:35:13,720 --> 02:35:17,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: terroristic yung kanyang tendency or activity,

4226
02:35:17,720 --> 02:35:20,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the system can read that.

4227
02:35:22,720 --> 02:35:25,720
