4249
02:36:30,720 --> 02:36:35,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: or that person is privileged enough to enter the Philippines.

4250
02:36:35,720 --> 02:36:37,720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po ang ano, yan po ang sistema na.

4251
02:36:37,720 --> 02:36:39,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's a very good, that's very good news.

